M = D/s lies in (1/14, 3/41)  <=>  41D/3 < s < 14D

  D    integer range for s        admissible s -> M
   1   (  13.67,  14)   NONE
   2   (  27.33,  28)   NONE
   3   (  41.00,  42)   NONE
   4   (  54.67,  56)   55 -> 4/55
   5   (  68.33,  70)   69 -> 5/69
   6   (  82.00,  84)   83 -> 6/83
   7   (  95.67,  98)   96 -> 7/96, 97 -> 7/97
